<title>FRANCE: Bomb kills two, wounds about 20 in Algiers cinema.</title>
<headline>Bomb kills two, wounds about 20 in Algiers cinema.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb killed two people and wounded about 20 in an Algiers cinema on Thursday afternoon, Algerian security forces said.</p>
<p>In a statement on the official news agency APS, the security forces said the bomb exploded in the central Sindbad cinema in Omar Bensheikh Street. The toll was provisional, they added.</p>
